{"id":"conv_04165","context":"Two elders reminisce about life in their youth","ambient":"living_room_quiet","cast":["hiroshi_elder","sachiko_grandma"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"Do you remember the occupation days? Life in that farming village was truly modest, looking back now.","jp":"占領下の頃を覚えとるかね。あの農村の暮らしは、今思えば本当に質素だったなあ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,3,5,8,16,21,41,51,73,87,99,289,341,376,411,771,984,1056,1636,1736,4805,4858,4870,9497,18972],"jpTokens":[{"s":"占領","r":"せんりょう","w":4858},{"s":"下","r":"か","w":376},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"頃","r":"ころ","w":411},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"覚え","r":"おぼえ","w":4805},{"s":"とる","w":1636},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"。"},{"s":"あの","w":341},{"s":"農村","r":"のうそん","w":4870},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"暮らし","r":"くらし","w":1736},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"、"},{"s":"今","r":"いま","w":87},{"s":"思え","r":"おもえ","w":99},{"s":"ば","w":41},{"s":"本当に","r":"ほんとうに","w":289},{"s":"質素","r":"しっそ","w":18972},{"s":"だっ","w":21},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"なあ","w":771},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"sachiko_grandma","mood":null,"en":"Yes, I remember it well. At the women's association meetings, we all used to mend kimonos together.","jp":"ええ、よく覚えていますよ。婦人会の集まりで、皆で着物を縫い直したものです。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,4,5,7,8,14,17,18,40,68,112,178,1056,1390,3039,3550,3859,4781,4805,4881,5979,7079,7885,8195,18099],"jpTokens":[{"s":"ええ","w":3039},{"s":"、"},{"s":"よく","w":178},{"s":"覚え","r":"おぼえ","w":4805},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"い","w":18},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"},{"s":"婦人","r":"ふじん","w":4881},{"s":"会","r":"かい","w":112},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"集まり","r":"あつまり","w":3859},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"、"},{"s":"皆","r":"みな","w":1390},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"着物","r":"きもの","w":7079},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"縫い","r":"ぬい"},{"s":"直し","r":"なおし","w":5979},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"もの","w":40},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"The news of the disarmament came over the radio, and I remember m